audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||For and against in Russian: против, ради, среди':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Say you are for or against, for whose sake and among whom in Russian: я про́тив, ра́ди дете́й, среди́ сосе́дей, at a debate about cars and trees.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:19yhys4'
    '|a||Май. Ма́ша живёт в Петербу́рге уже́ почти́ два го́да. Today: a debate at her museum.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Музе́й нахо́дится ря́дом с у́лицей, где всегда́ маши́ны. Я сижу́ среди́ посети́телей.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1jna22x'
    '|a||Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ly4qwf'
    '|b||До́брый ве́чер! Сего́дня мы обсужда́ем у́лицу ря́дом с музе́ем. Кто за, а кто про́тив маши́н?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6640
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:fpqb5c'
    '|a||Я за то, что́бы там не́ было маши́н. Ра́ди дете́й и ра́ди чи́стого во́здуха.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Но не́которые возража́ют: им ну́жно е́здить на рабо́ту.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3920
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Среди́ мои́х сосе́дей то́же есть таки́е. Но у́лица без маши́н безопа́снее.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||А е́сли постро́ить но́вую доро́гу?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Стро́ить — до́рого. И там дере́вья и пти́цы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Спаси́бо. Э́то ва́жно для всего́ о́бщества.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3560
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||И для посети́телей музе́я!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What is the evening about?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||У́лица ря́дом с музе́ем.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Is Tom for or against cars on the street by the museum? (про́тив = against)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Про́тив: ра́ди дете́й и во́здуха.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Why do some people object (возража́ют)?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Им ну́жно е́здить на рабо́ту.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Why doesn''t Tom want a new road? (стро́ить = to build; дере́вья = trees; пти́цы = birds)':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Стро́ить до́рого. И там дере́вья и пти́цы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те: за и про́тив. За, for. Про́тив, against.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||За: ра́ди дете́й, ра́ди чи́стого во́здуха. Ра́ди: for the sake of.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:177sckt'
    '|a||Без маши́н безопа́снее. И там дере́вья и пти́цы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1hgbput'
    '|a||Про́тив: им ну́жно е́здить на рабо́ту. Они́ возража́ют: they object.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12ntwj5'
    '|a||Среди́ мои́х сосе́дей то́же есть таки́е. Среди́: among. Сосе́ди: neighbours.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:jth366'
    '|a||The endings in teal: the of-case. Like без and для, про́тив, ра́ди and среди́ take the of-case.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9kukj'
    '|a||Про́тив чего́? Я про́тив маши́н.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:18qixag'
    '|a||Ра́ди кого́? Ра́ди дете́й. Ра́ди чего́? Ра́ди чи́стого во́здуха.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1n4312c'
    '|a||Среди́ кого́? Среди́ сосе́дей, среди́ посети́телей.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:10aelrd'
    '|a||А за, for, usually takes the object case, in green: кто за но́вую доро́гу?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ssau3u'
    '|a||И про́сто: Я за! Я про́тив!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:100nrdl'
    '|a||Но́вые слова́. Де́рево, дере́вья: trees. Пти́ца, a bird. Во́здух: air.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:15mu7vw'
    '|a||Опа́сная у́лица, безопа́сная у́лица: dangerous, safe. Без маши́н безопа́снее.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:m3785f'
    '|a||Стро́ить: to build, the doing partner of постро́ить. Стро́ить до́рого.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:167wl1m'
    '|a||Обсужда́ть, обсуди́ть: to discuss. О́бщество: society.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9ib4hl'
    '|a||И возража́ть, to object, про́тив чего́: не́которые возража́ют про́тив у́лицы без маши́н.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:nwrop3'
    '|a||Я не возража́ю: I don''t mind.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ti7clu'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1vizvrv'
    '|a||Вы́берите: за, про́тив, ра́ди or среди́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:l3wk88'
    '|a||Кто за, а кто про́тив?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Я про́тив маши́н: я хожу́ пешко́м.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:10dv4nt'
    '|a||Мы закрыва́ем у́лицу ра́ди дете́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:cuit9c'
    '|a||В музе́е среди́ посети́телей мно́го дете́й. Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:r2muh2'
    '|a||Напиши́те по-ру́сски:':
      mp3: 
