      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:pff0vv'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Я про́тив маши́н в це́нтре.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||По́сле ве́чера Ма́ша шу́тит: тепе́рь она́ про́тив. По́сле диало́га нажми́те Practise.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов. Сосе́дка, Ни́на Петро́вна, то́же слы́шала об у́лице. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:e15zck'
    '|b||Том, я слы́шала, в музе́е обсужда́ли у́лицу. Вы за и́ли про́тив маши́н?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4680
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1k8xmub'
    '|a||Я про́тив. Ра́ди дете́й и ра́ди чи́стого во́здуха.':
      mp3: 
